WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.250
[Punk beat. A camera moves through Cancel City.]
Another normal day.

00:02.250 --> 00:04.800
[Foil crinkles and tears.]
A pack opens. Public menace detected.

00:04.800 --> 00:06.250
Final Boss Karen: “I kept the receipts.”

00:06.250 --> 00:07.650
[A receipt printer accelerates.]
Printing your downfall.

00:07.650 --> 00:09.250
Reply Guy: “Actually, according to—”
Receipt Apocalypse!

00:09.250 --> 00:10.200
[Heavy paper impact.]
Ratio.

00:10.200 --> 00:11.120
[The music stops.]
Thread locked. “I am the manager.”

00:11.120 --> 00:12.150
[A tiny squeak. A receipt startles Karen.]
Paper cut. Emotional damage.

00:12.150 --> 00:14.800
[Final punk sting.]
Cancel City. Everyone is the problem.
Pull. Fight. Repeat.
